2026-11-06T21:24Z DECISION. To fit the 1-2h budget across ten tracks, each track is researched by a separate research agent that writes its own track file in full. Run in two waves of five. Each track file is committed (and pushed) individually as soon as it lands, so no more than one track's findings is ever unwritten in any one worker, and nothing is held only in memory. This departs from a literal "one track at a time" sequence; logged as a judgement call.
